!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA was extracted using Qiagen AllPrep per manufacturer instructions from formalin-fixed, paraffin-embedded (FFPE) tissue sections, using macrodissection when needed to enrich for tumor content.  RNA was analyzed on an Agilent Bioanalyzer.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Libraries were constructed from 400 ng RNA and sequenced as 150 bp paired-end reads on an Illumina 4000.  Cases meeting the following 5 criteria were included in the sequenced cohort: (1) adequate tissue for extraction; (2) tumor content ≥50%; (3) adequate extracted RNA; (4) RNA DV200 ≥20%; and (5) adequate sequencing data quality.
!Sample_data_processing = raw mRNA sequencing data were processed using MAP-Rse2 configured to use the hg38 genome and Ensemble version 78 transcriptome to produce gene-level raw read count data.  For unsupervised differential expression analysis, data were input into edgeR and log2-transformed, and normalized read count data were extracted for analysis.
!Sample_data_processing = Assembly: hg38
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary files format and content: Tab-delimited file of raw count data
